    "note": "player 1's fighter in the ring, one of the two of its team (MAME cheat database, P1 Select Character A and B at 0x1088EC and 0x1088EE); the high bit is the colour (the robot's recording of 2026-11-16: 0x88 then 0x01 as Gordon and Eagle take turns)"
   },
