   },
   "_p1_dir": {
    "addr": "0x10820F",
    "type": "u8",
    "note": "the side player 1's fighter faces: a motion of the stick reads the other way round when the fighter faces left (1.39). What the byte holds when a round starts is learnt as facing right. The byte of its block that the FBNeo training mode reads in player 2's; the robot's recording of 2026-11-16 reads 0 and 2 at 14 round starts out of 19 and opposite values 96% of the fights"
   },
   "_p2_dir": {
    "addr": "0x10840F",
    "type": "u8",
